WEBVTT

00:03:29.897 --> 00:03:32.030
This is Petra in Jordan.

00:03:32.463 --> 00:03:34.563
The ancient city contained a church,

00:03:34.597 --> 00:03:37.197
a theater and tombs for the dead.

00:03:37.497 --> 00:03:40.997
Families lived in two
and three-bedroom apartments.

00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:43.897
We've come a long way.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.297
Some of the structures
that remain are rather mysterious,

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.130
some are otherworldly,

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:53.563
some are glorious odes to love,

00:03:53.597 --> 00:03:55.797
some house the souls of the dead.

00:03:56.497 --> 00:03:58.963
Some have forced us to choose sides.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:02.197
Some have succumbed
to the power of nature.